Workspaces for Herdr

mods/ws-spaces, mods/ws-agents, mods/ws-chrome, mods/ws-tabs and
mods/ws-new-menu are modified copies of the `spaces`, `agents`,
`workspace-chrome`, `tabs` and `new-menu` mods shipped with Herdr (herdr-app
0.1.14, https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under the Apache
License 2.0. The changes are described at the top of each file, and the icons
in mods/ws-chrome and mods/ws-tabs are Herdr's own.

